## 7. Attribution and proof limits

Future-output equivalence, synchronization, square-root/Hellinger discrimination, conditional expectation as orthogonal projection and finite-state Markov theory are established methods. [Travers–Crutchfield, Exact Synchronization][TCe], Theorem 1 and Proposition 1, treat strongly connected finite unifilar probabilistically distinct sources with exact synchronization. Their [Asymptotic Synchronization][TCa], §VI Theorem 1 and §VII.1 Proposition 3, treat the nonexact case and include periodic chains. These are current-state uncertainty results, distinct from ordinary next-symbol entropy and from the actual P8 erased-center fields.

On a strongly connected quotient, their bound $H_{\rm bits}(Q_{\rm final}\mid\text{word})\le C\alpha^r$ is an alternative classical supplier: $1-\max_a p_a\le H_{\rm nats}(p)=(\ln2)H_{\rm bits}(p)$, and Theorem 2.3 then gives $e_L,e_R\le(\ln2)C\alpha^r$. The direct proof in §3 supplies the stated reducible and periodic scope without imposing strong connectivity or using ordinary prediction entropy as an erasure proxy.

[Shuval–Tal][ST], §X-A/B, supplies the exact arrival-observation convention and Condition K used in §5. Its conditional hidden-endpoint forgetting theorem is an additional-hypothesis mechanism, not a general finite-hidden erasure theorem. Positive-rectangle projective contraction is classical Birkhoff theory; see [Lemmens–Nussbaum][LN], §2.1, Theorem 2.9. Those older word-contraction mechanisms and the finite response certificate are credited rather than reauthored.

[Universal][U] owns the complete producer domain, actual-law construction, component interface and compact separation criterion. [Renewal][R] owns same-law trimming. [Conditional Response][P8] owns the actual one-sided fields, attained-law boundary budget and null-response theorem. [Multiword][MW] owns the vanishing-tail finite consumer. Relative to these supplied interfaces, the present ordinary synthesis is the explicit two-orientation task-loss comparison, its independent restricted allowance and the supported-word law-invariant strict-scope witness. Packaging or repeating a mature rate is not a further discovery.

This is a scoped comparison, without global novelty, hidden or six-state/support minimality, efficient radii, empirical machine-learning gain, general nonunifilar completion or kernel-verification claims. The original objective and response interfaces are reused under their supplied hypotheses; the tail and guard proofs themselves need no attainment premise. No mathematical program, numerical or finite-enumeration evidence is a premise of these proofs.

